WEBVTT

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:07.980
Experiment No. 15
Coitsu Nate Luna D

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.580
S-so sleepy...

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.750
"Are you all right, Ma'am?"

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.000
You should be askin'!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.330
Love always drives me, and yet

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:41.770
The wind against the glass 
creates an image of you

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:47.230
What "color" will that wind be today?
I want to experience it, completely

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:50.270
Off in the corners of the classroom

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:53.570
Through the tiniest of magics

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:58.410
Another miracle occurs!

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.830
A premonition of love

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:05.580
My heart shouldn't be so uneasy, 
I don't know what's next

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.500
Aah! What is it that throws 
my heart into turmoil?

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.000
This sudden spark

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.760
Love always drives me, and yet

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.330
Someone, someday, deliver 
these feelings to you!

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:26.540
LAB

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.580
"Were you up late last night?"

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:26.540
You should be askin'!

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.420
"So then, that means...?"

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.540
You should be askin'!

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:31.580
I'm not sure what to make 
of that last part there...

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:34.830
But, Ma'am, if you're that tired,
shouldn't you just go home?

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:35.540
No!

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.750
I don't wanna go home today!

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:39.830
You don't say...

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.080
"And why don't you want to go home?"

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:43.540
You should be askin'!

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:46.170
It's as if the words bounce right off you!

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:48.910
You're like the egg crate 
soundproofing foam that's on the

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:50.820
walls in the music room!

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:54.000
Ma'am, you don't seem 
sleepy at all right now...

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.970
Listen up, Tanaka: There are times when,
though sleep beckons,

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:58.510
the only choice is to persevere!

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:00.630
And it is such cases...

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:05.040
that THIS item is of use!

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.000
Coitsu Nate Luna D!

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.110
It contains the next-generation 
ingredient Siestorin,

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.160
which dispels fatigue by 
providing the equivalent

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.990
of 10 hours' worth of uninterrupted sleep.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:19.420
This, combined with the effects of the
ingredient henjinate, creates a "sub-personality"

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:22.960
that allows for thought processes
distinct from the conscious self.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:29.130
In other words, these pills allow one to engage
in rational dialogue even when asleep!

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.130
Now take one!

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.500
Uh, no, I'm not really sleepy.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.790
You should try this one out yourself, Ma'am.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:40.510
What's this, Tanaka-kun?
Could it be that you haven't noticed?

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.420
Today, when I came back to the classroom...

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:45.130
Till just a little while ago,
Yamashita and I were COMPLETELY asleep!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:45.130
Today, when I came back to the classroom...

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:44.540
YEAH, YEAH.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.540
YEAH, YEAH.
ASLEEP

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.080
As of now, Yamashita 
remains in a deep slumber!

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:50.520
Huh? But she's reading a book and...

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:55.520
SUPREME
ENLIGHTENMENT
An Introduction to the Items
of Buddhist Ritual NAMU

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.750
Ah! If you look closely, 
she's actually sleeping!

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:59.330
Go on, say something to Yamashita's
well-formed sub-personality!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.030
Okay.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:04.350
Yamashita-san? Are you awake?

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.920
Direct all questions to my lawyer.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.330
That's one aggressive personality...

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.040
Are you awake, Yamashita-san?

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.790
I had a dream I was being sexually harassed.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:17.460
I'm sorry, Yamashita,
but Tanaka WAS sexually harassing you just now.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.510
Please stop spreading lies.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.130
Main

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:22.130
So, as you can see, conversation is possible


00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:26.510
Main
Sub

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.410
without a direct link to 
the sleeping consciousness.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.510
It seems sort of like sleepwalking.

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:31.540
And now it is YOUR turn, Tanaka.
One can never have too much data!

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.080
When you take this, you 
will enter a deep sleep.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.130
I have a bad feeling.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:43.290
Oh, no! I really am getting sleep...

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:48.630
Tanaka, are you asleep?

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:49.880
I am.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.630
Are you REALLY asleep?

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.380
I am asleep.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.580
I don't know...

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.540
What finger is this?

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:06.130
Your left pinky.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:10.290
Oh, yeah? And what's your favorite food?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:13.130
I like the outer skin of daifuku rice cakes.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:17.580
Which do you prefer, long hair or short?

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.170
I like long hair.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:21.210
Ooh, really?

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:22.580
Ma'am.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:24.530
O-oh, yeah.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.750
Now then, to get right to the point...

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.540
Hey, Tanaka.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.040
The thing is...

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:38.920
Tanaka, would you say your 
feelings for me are-?

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.000
Ma'am, how did I do?

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:50.210
Staaaare

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:58.790
Ma'am, I'm awake. Like, completely awake.

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.040
Ma'am?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.420
I'm so... asleep!

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:10.750
Ma'am? W-wait! Ma'am!

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.790
Are you going home already? It's quite early.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.330
Yes, go back, hngrh...

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.000
SCIENCE

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.710
Please be careful.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.210
I wonder if she'll be all right...

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:33.380
The trial regarding this
sexual harassment case shall now begin!

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:34.830
Please don't be fooled by this.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.040
I sentence the gutter trash
of a defendant named "Tanaka" to death!

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:38.920
Objection.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:46.630
SCIENCE

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.540
SCIENCE
Experiment No. 16
Pero-Lilion

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.540
Experiment No. 16
Pero-Lilion

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.040
You're late, Tanaka!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.330
Is my brother here?

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:05.210
They're not going to know 
who "my brother" is.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.510
Oh, yeah.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.710
Is a 2nd-year named "Tanaka" here?!

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:09.790
Watch your tone!

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.380
No, Tanaka the 2nd-year hasn't shown up yet.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:15.380
See? I told you we should 
ask the teachers first.

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:17.580
I'M the one who said that.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:21.080
Ah, Yamashita-san!
You're in the same study club as well?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.250
Is she in your class?

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.380
That's right. Wait, don't 
you know who that is?

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:30.000
She's Tanaka-sempai's younger sister.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.630
Well, the thing is-

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:35.170
Wait, Yamashita-san!

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.500
It would seem some 
introductions are in order.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.050
I'm Mizuna Tanaka from 
Class 1-2. My favorite food

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:43.290
is the fillings of 
traditional Japanese candy.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:48.330
I'm Yomogi Tanaka from Class 1-6.
My favorite flavor is chocolate mint!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.920
I'm the older twin sister...

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.510
And I'm the younger!

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:55.540
Wait, twins?!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.750
Yamashita-san, is this the 
first time to hear we're twins?

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.540
Well, we're not a lot alike.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.880
Do you mind if we wait here 
till our brother shows up?

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:05.540
Feel free.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.540
Strange... How could I 
have not known about this?

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:14.000
Still, in the past, I have spotted multiple
Tanaka heads poking out from the crowd.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:18.250
I thought I was hallucinating,
but looking back, I guess it was these two.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:23.000
And yet, what does it mean that
Tanaka hasn't mentioned them even once?!

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:26.540
Staaare.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.130
You want one?

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:32.510
Yaay!

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:38.210
This candy is SO delicious!

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:40.630
Me too! I want one!

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:44.170
Wow, you're right! It's choco-mint!

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:46.020
Huh? It tastes like soy flour, right?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:49.630
What are you talking about, Mizuna-chan?
There's not a trace of soy flour in this!

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:54.240
Yeah, well, I'm not seeing
any signs of choco-mint either!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.830
Sorry I'm late.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.500
Ah! Brother!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.290
Hey, Big Brother, look!
What flavor do you think this candy is?

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.700
Personally, I think it 
tastes like rice flour.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:08.200
What are you doing here?
And did you bring that candy to school?

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.710
No, your club president gave it to us!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:14.050
Oh, really? It's all right if they have this?

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:16.010
S-sure, yeah.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.960
It looks like something that she's made...

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:23.080
You two, give that back right now.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.200
Come on, Big Brother, just listen!

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:30.040
This has a robust flavor, but then
the sweetness of the soybeans really packs a punch,

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.960
resulting in the ideal flavor profile!

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.170
The slight bitterness of 
the chocolate enveloped

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.720
in sweet mint makes for 
a brisk taste sensation!

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.540
This is the picture of choco-mint!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:44.080
What about this is choco-mint?!
Every single one of your taste buds is wrecked!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:48.630
If THIS tastes like soy flour,
you must think sand tastes pretty sweet!

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.290
Brother!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.830
Tell us once and for all what flavor this is!

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:53.790
Hey!

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:55.510
Cut that out.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.250
Come on! Come on!

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.460
Stop it!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.790
Don't put things in your mouth and
then try giving them to other people!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.000
SHOCK

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:07.710
It's not like we're strangers...

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.380
And don't go splitting hairs!

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:12.850
You need to stop always acting like children.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:15.350
This is why I don't introduce 
you to other people.

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:17.600
You haven't even shown your respects
to the club captain, have you?

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:18.830
Mizuna-chan...

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.530
No, we haven't.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:24.880
Having you two around here
has embarrassed me to no end.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:27.500
Hey! You'll make Yomogi-chan cry!

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.830
I'm the one who wants to cry!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:32.290
You two, line up.
You're going to apologize to the club captain.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.630
I'm very sorry, Ma'am.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:36.050
We're sorry.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.380
No, no, really, it's fine.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:40.510
Look, I have another candy 
here. There's one more.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:43.630
Ma'am, I have a favor I'd like to ask.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:47.170
Could you please explain
how the candy works to these two?

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:51.610
If you do that, the way you always do,

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:55.030
I think they'll understand 
just what they've done.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.130
O-oh, yeah...

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:58.130
Please.

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.380
Please!

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:01.420
Still, I mean, you know...

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:04.540
I feel like the weather's turning bad.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:08.040
I think maybe we should just 
call it quits for today.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.170
There, you see?! You're the 
ones responsible for this!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.630
You need to own up to what you've done!

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:16.830
Stop casually smacking us on the head!
We're not bongos, you know!

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:19.010
We're members of the Tanaka family,
not percussion instruments!

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:23.710
The Pero-Lilion uses the newly discovered,
next-century sweetener lolilion

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:26.750
to create a candy that has
no direct effect upon the body.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:30.670
Instead, it induces a hallucinatory sense
of whatever the taster regards as "sweet."
